r backgrounds and inputs.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "React JS"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#4FC3F7",\n    "secondary": "#FFF8E1",\n    "accent": "#26A69A"\n  },\n  "theme": "auto",\n  "layoutDescription": "Home screen features a prominent \'+ Log New Session\' button and a scrollable list of session cards. Logging a session uses a form with icon-based and slider inputs. Session details are shown in a card with edit/delete options. Stats dashboard uses simple, colorful charts. Oceanic backgrounds and icons are used throughout."\n}'}",
